{"3880420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fix & Flick", "steam_appid": 3880420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4805730], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=800 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL IN A FLICK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are Jimmy Flickerman, a young man now living alone in the family shop passed down through generations. Ever since SICRED took over, you've spent most of your days playing video games in the darkness of the storage room. But when your name is unexpectedly drawn in this year's early lottery for reasons unknown, everything changes in a flick. For the next few weeks, you are the appointed officer of this year's festival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/802a62ad67d685ca8079ad920cf07041.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/802a62ad67d685ca8079ad920cf07041.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/802a62ad67d685ca8079ad920cf07041.mp4?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WAKE UP</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And check the garage. Receive and organize your deliveries. Fix your consoles and attend to the customers who take part in this system. Dedicate yourself to your work and carry out your duties without question. Maintain a professional level of communication with your customers. Remember, you are now a SICRED employee.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/55bbc9fb330006969b5aea4547df019e.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/55bbc9fb330006969b5aea4547df019e.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/55bbc9fb330006969b5aea4547df019e.mp4?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DAY AND NIGHT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, serve customers and trade second-hand consoles. By night, fix and stock more devices for the days ahead. Work hard. Stay productive. And never waver in your loyalty to SICRED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/4b21fe256fd947b9a01af965dd0849fb.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/4b21fe256fd947b9a01af965dd0849fb.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/4b21fe256fd947b9a01af965dd0849fb.mp4?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an immersive first-person narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, repair, and modify retro game consoles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain with your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business and increase your renown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in branching conversations through an interactive dialogue system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and build important relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a mysterious story.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=800 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL IN A FLICK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are Jimmy Flickerman, a young man now living alone in the family shop passed down through generations. Ever since SICRED took over, you've spent most of your days playing video games in the darkness of the storage room. But when your name is unexpectedly drawn in this year's early lottery for reasons unknown, everything changes in a flick. For the next few weeks, you are the appointed officer of this year's festival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/802a62ad67d685ca8079ad920cf07041.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/802a62ad67d685ca8079ad920cf07041.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/802a62ad67d685ca8079ad920cf07041.mp4?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WAKE UP</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And check the garage. Receive and organize your deliveries. Fix your consoles and attend to the customers who take part in this system. Dedicate yourself to your work and carry out your duties without question. Maintain a professional level of communication with your customers. Remember, you are now a SICRED employee.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/55bbc9fb330006969b5aea4547df019e.poster.avif?t=1781539982\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/55bbc9fb330006969b5aea4547df019e.webm?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/55bbc9fb330006969b5aea4547df019e.mp4?t=1781539982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DAY AND NIGHT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, serve customers and trade second-hand consoles. By night, fix and stock more devices for the days ahead. Work hard. Stay productive. And never waver in your loyalty to SICRED.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/4b21